e_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/38896770-22b2-4cfc-9d09-b694e6c55cf0.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "日语学习", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "今日，话题词“库克承认是看华为等厂家出折叠机才出的”登上微博热搜。\n\n\n据外媒苹果首席记者古尔曼透露，苹果公司决定认真开发折叠屏手机的节点大约在2020年前后。当时，苹果前CEO库克刚结束亚洲行，回来后对折叠屏手机感到“异常兴奋”——他在中国等亚洲国家看到越来越多的消费者开始使用华为、三星等竞品推出的折叠屏手机，因此确", "published_at": "2026-09-11T16:08:39Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:05:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-0e3b8a5ba11b.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-b4ac8c270dde", "title": "从找路到找店，高德还要找到AI时代的生存答案", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781592", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/content_default_19.jpg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "旅行探店", "科技"], "excerpt": "9月10日，高德发布扫街榜2026并举行年度颁奖典礼。\n\n\n但在这场以榜单命名的发布会上，高德真正想强调的或许并不是榜单本身。\n\n\n同日，高德推出3D原生城市世界模型ABot-Earth", "published_at": "2026-09-11T16:08:22Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:05:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-b4ac8c270dde.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-aeade3f32235", "title": "甲骨文跳涨8.5%后转跌！AI需求强难消巨额烧钱与利润担忧", "source": "华尔街见闻", "author": "", "url": "https://wallstreetcn.com/articles/3781598", "image_url": "https://wpimg-wscn.awtmt.com/cff05d3f-cb9b-4a5c-a066-f1ce7196ca2c.jpeg", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Finance", "topic": "zh_money", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Finance", "text", "zh", "zh_money", "华尔街见闻", "投资", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "甲骨文上一财季业绩超预期强劲，备受关注的AI基础设施云业务收入更是同比翻倍猛增，但这份亮眼财报并未让股价一路上扬。\n\n\n美东时间9月11日周五，甲骨文（ORCL）股价跳空高