ods 5 等新品。\n\n首款 iPhone 折叠屏", "published_at": "2026-09-09T22:38:42Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:05:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-ed0736a05153.json", "engagement": 180, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-185f766f3d7c", "title": "iPhone Duo 最惊艳的一秒，让我重新理解液态玻璃", "source": "爱范儿", "author": "莫崇宇", "url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1679530?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image_url": "https://s3.ifanr.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/111-5.png", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "健身", "投资", "旅行探店", "游戏", "爱范儿", "科技"], "excerpt": "iPhone Duo 发布之后，争议的声浪远比想象中更加撕裂。APPSO 的评论区也快打起来了。\n\n但无论对折叠屏抱有怎样的态度，看过发布会的人大概都很难忽略 iPhone Duo 所展现出来的动画效果。\n\n不得不说，软硬件协作这块，苹果确实是手拿把捏。而回头再看一年前 Liquid", "published_at": "2026-09-11T07:27:51Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:05:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-185f766f3d7c.json", "engagement": 170, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-0918680a9590", "title": "一年融3轮，哈工程海洋工程团队「工至海洋」打造深海机器人，已获亿元意向订单 | 水下项目", "source": "36氪", "author": "", "url": "https://36kr.com/p/3977372742250756?f=rss", "image_url": "https://img.36krcdn.com/hsossms/20260910/v2_1f0c196688da40b499d1c1f4d91fae86@5688585_oswg720408oswg1080oswg489_img_000?x-oss-process=image/format,jpg/interlace,1", "video_url": null, "thumbnail_url": null, "duration_secs": 0, "downloadable": false, "category": "Tech", "topic": "zh_tech", "content_type": "text", "lang": "zh", "tags": ["36氪", "Tech", "text", "zh", "zh_tech", "投资", "社会话题", "科技"], "excerpt": "1854年，一个叫菲尔德的年轻人决定用海底电缆横贯大西洋。经过数次失败，几乎所有股东要求终止计划后，1858年8月，电缆终于铺通，英国女王的声音通过电缆传到美国，人类第一次以分钟为单位，跨越大洋传递信息。\n\n\n169年后的今天，全球海底光缆的总长度已经超过140万公里，承载95%以上的跨洲数据传输，但人类对海缆的日常维", "published_at": "2026-09-11T20:03:47Z", "curated_at": "2026-09-11T20:05:13Z", "body": "bodies/feed-0918680a9590.json", "engagement": 160, "opens": 0, "upvotes": 0}, {"id": "feed-da1e06a7a556", "title": "清华博士团队切入离子阱量子